---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description={`Who writes ${SITE_TITLE} and why.`}
	pubDate={new Date('July 28 2026')}
>
	<p>
		I build AI software and agent systems, and I write down what actually works. Most of what gets
		published about this field is speculation. These are notes from shipped work: the design calls,
		the failure modes, and the parts that only show up once something is running in production.
	</p>

	<!-- TODO(eugene): replace with your own bio and credentials.
